[{"id":"425","date":"2026-10-02T19:48:48+00:00","text":"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"417","date":"2026-10-02T19:43:15+00:00","text":"French magazine “LOVE” has announced a GTA 6 feature in its upcoming Issue 27, with a new artwork of Jason and Lucia: - The magazine interviewed Rockstar North co-studio head Rob Nelson - Rob Nelson says Rockstar hopes players will want to “escape into these worlds and these characters and get lost with them and in them” - The interview focuses on Rockstar’s approach to world-building, characters, and creating an immersive world where every character feels meaningful - The physical issue will be available October 5 @RockstarGames 😠","image":"https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/qOKfvsZPjAJqwleKLl2lrs6iR-5hyQYrFwtJIRXXuwCOj2FhBDnPXcg50qlhWI8I0N_VkAjR-rFKYE5QKf70sn60E9gxGxAW4uYsV7EXQTyknpxF55sNPECFmY-GTocH9koMzdtVeM2rN3qKYiMsEg_ic-iylAokhzlgMA5H71UOXUPs-WkADbBB27dx4Z_T9qdt7NOTH7vsiyYQAfY3yQHR6L3xYSDTwkMIZQh94W_Wd4-OdwAQOneqs2Yj7t_w0HQzjzph2pyaMlqWyOvYemes_KI0e0FsMcMKmzLRXOMPfjhs8F3ApP-b7AHTi1DX36gvQ0ZYOIbGNLaBbV15oQ.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"416","date":"2026-10-02T19:42:40+00:00","text":"Rockstar Games is officially teaming up with the Miami HEAT for a special “Night in Vice City” on November 18 at the Kaseya Center. The HEAT will temporarily rebrand as Vice City and face the Milwaukee Bucks, featuring: - An all-new Vice City uniform - A special hardwood court built for the game - Unique Vice City-themed game-night activations - Special activities inside Kaseya Center starting on opening night A new Vice City collection of apparel is also available on HEAT’s website: http://HEAT.com/ViceCity @RockstarGames 😠","image":"https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/vWBH8qiDZUZvuLr5Du-euMdudgfFB0Frv1y_3RjxgqEQ01pl_G1HjDGi3heVJGifCB4YQuIxtSZu6dlqQvYuyRgze5raZhsdP7DsqnRBHMor-TCKBQsfU5Ojj5ECG1ctFapsju61VQ-ZGRao3M5ovDUzOZX2vA2_RFGgK1W4WzwFYbzeCiG3HGeBd8iaxihciOMYT3wfAjw3JP3AnInKh2RvNUuIyiieQ35bP_ORdbNN_7Y9glVPamYXrbab3ZV5EEvjeSG4K7ip